#: scenario5:scenario5_49EC72D7_464F_45AE_83CA_75CC4C81372F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3fdb9ac7e10a1846b3df60b683382fe8443c01f04f43390de9c85fcc3429931d
#. default-sha256: cb5eb042e56c23acd4fc77ad9fb374ef1bec334a503098aa0aa6e9c559d7813e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_49EC72D7_464F_45AE_83CA_75CC4C81372F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Several days had passed since the "
"package arrived; ⟪k:12⟫the end of my third week living in the mansion was drawing near."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Erano passati diversi giorni da "
"quando il pacco era arrivato;⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫la fine della mia terza settimana nella villa si stava "
"avvicinando."

#: scenario5:scenario5_6150F9D5_5DDC_43DF_A513_607F62A542F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd18ace3f96cb40c3557a2a47de9398dfbf8d306d38a83845fd184a1791878fa
#. default-sha256: a781e18cfaface7eb7098415c9b507167eacefac41be240beab689c216a0db7d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6150F9D5_5DDC_43DF_A513_607F62A542F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel wasn’t getting any friendlier, either. ⟪k:1⟫He continued to either snub or bluntly "
"dismiss me whenever we crossed paths."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E Michel non era affatto più amichevole. ⟪k:1⟫Continuava ad ignorarmi⟪k:2⟫e a respingermi "
"bruscamente ogni volta che ci incontravamo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_653649AD_016A_4720_AF8F_1972915C5AE5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6e94aee740dbd9d36ac1851300d5af74be590da597d8031b4c02a5d73f370e3
#. default-sha256: 69bd4724863be339b81ff4b6d07b42b54f830e8d942e227f5310d1189843c998
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_653649AD_016A_4720_AF8F_1972915C5AE5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I didn’t understand why he acted that way around me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non capivo il motivo per cui si comportasse in quel modo con me."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A8D1483C_9648_4012_B28C_2634220D8C98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b4041224413451307f325ac857c8b83c6779658bc9026e54ed3f144117af6d27
#. default-sha256: 963235fcf80eb7b26bd26a0fa5f53072c9e8d11749210c2f45529afdfbfc19ee
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A8D1483C_9648_4012_B28C_2634220D8C98"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But there was little point in asking when he seemed to think there was little point in "
"talking to me at all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma non aveva molto senso chiederglielo, fintanto che pensava⟪k:1⟫che non ci fosse alcuna "
"ragione per parlarmi."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F46A383E_C563_49CD_9477_40CF746506DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 092b5d8ca72ae556bfc97f9c58e37a2fc8a47b3e89738911870fe982f36bdc7d
#. default-sha256: 8f810ed6329bbdab42d2aa86932641ccbedb6cbaf96015bdc1b97a42b5b7f32d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F46A383E_C563_49CD_9477_40CF746506DB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Although at first I had been sure there was some way to get him to warm up to me,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sebbene all’inizio fossi sicura che in qualche modo sarei riuscita⟪k:1⟫a farmi accettare da "
"lui,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_424348E1_F5B1_4CF9_B0EF_CE05648831F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 765c358282f005e0366eabdd2bb318aeb44f1bf6205e9392001912f5b318249f
#. default-sha256: 0859dc5b2c5f5989b5864caccd22b689b20584dfb4f89f65a1ea7720083d0009
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_424348E1_F5B1_4CF9_B0EF_CE05648831F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫the more time I spent in the mansion, the more my willpower began to feel like it was at its "
"breaking point."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫più tempo trascorrevo nella villa, più la mia forza di volontà⟪k:1⟫si avvicinava al punto di "
"rottura."

#: scenario5:scenario5_75DBADEE_BB49_47B3_98C8_A69797C4FF12
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f88f1b93483c52c1ca24ead401fe387ec6f558359b1b3f8ee69cf1734f2eab78
#. default-sha256: 086c2bb87b3197ec0c9b119e71eb76c46b9c302e53e5f74a483748edb1527513
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_75DBADEE_BB49_47B3_98C8_A69797C4FF12"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I could tell myself to stay positive until I was blue in the face,⟪k:1⟫but it would only "
"work for so long."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avrei potuto dire a me stessa di essere ottimista fino all’esaurimento,⟪k:1⟫ma avrebbe "
"funzionato solo per poco."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B8A2906C_3079_44F8_ADFE_0610C9535338
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb9fba1f23e12603786ceb0302b91f58682f849b502daaccf509ca42a64b69eb
#. default-sha256: 28573599bf922615b71ed94f5f5cf2e820797edba70965fc61c63702522acc95
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B8A2906C_3079_44F8_ADFE_0610C9535338"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(The one pretty place in the whole house...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(L’unico posto piacevole in tutta la casa...)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9DED7EEC_0722_4C45_9EF7_A984612FE73D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6bf112f95a1d10c91b690ea1e17aff85548b6aed32c88f6f7120bba146ae3cae
#. default-sha256: 9289be90db6643b02d66047dff165cfa479a679b49a1bd00c6f63194980c1791
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9DED7EEC_0722_4C45_9EF7_A984612FE73D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I’m glad he hasn’t covered it back up.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Sono felice che Michel non l’abbia coperta di nuovo.)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_65804540_F115_420D_AE61_DAB5CE7E94E9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a9dae50e754fa4c377cfe9eecb645d2e53fda61e381547a956a6544b402a3fc
#. default-sha256: dc6835c045826919086687bbc234dc5b26242aa2cb73e34c5d76de91dfbd61d7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_65804540_F115_420D_AE61_DAB5CE7E94E9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Blue moonlight shone quietly through the stained-glass window,⟪k:1⟫vainly illuminating some "
"of the room."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il chiaro di luna splendeva silenziosamente attraverso la finestra colorata, illuminando "
"invano parte della stanza."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B0B8F114_8698_4BC0_86F8_3007E9A895A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd0c9ce08a38e3612e9ad2ac5435af65e96f5b307b09f8455ed24802f975df64
#. default-sha256: d1afe11a484928fade877d475822f55a0dbec9cc48ab244b4d0ece8caeee13d4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B0B8F114_8698_4BC0_86F8_3007E9A895A9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I hadn’t noticed until now, but the room with the stained-glass window appeared to be "
"modeled after a chapel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non l’avevo mai notato prima, ma la stanza con la vetrata sembrava essere modellata su una "
"cappella."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A0C7AE40_F8C8_4EDA_820A_38D0F5F09337
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 331fdde57fc14272f2944f53fc3b5052a0bf4e2cc9f214aac3cc603b4f92566e
#. default-sha256: fad8aae9927ac6adc2a47f0850748b5a9111666ff4bd33e484f8e7e7fb4afb9c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A0C7AE40_F8C8_4EDA_820A_38D0F5F09337"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Rows of pews faced the window, below which sat what used to be a pulpit."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫File di panche erano rivolte verso la finestra, sotto la quale si trovava quello che una "
"volta era un pulpito."

#: scenario5:scenario5_8C9CA69D_1F12_443C_9D1B_FEB57319275B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f20d8e3fdab96c81b1bece2a0999dd9fc699c25000463484230044157c8eabf8
#. default-sha256: cc1e9f38d6c9dc02d262838255728ff23e8970a7577bd4b95ff6d3b5860e5ddb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8C9CA69D_1F12_443C_9D1B_FEB57319275B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was very little left of it, though, and an awkward length of silver was mounted to the "
"pulpit’s front face—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ne era rimasto ben poco, comunque, e sulla facciata anteriore vi era montato uno strano "
"pezzo d’argento—"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7264E601_7DDD_4CA2_9E95_82FC86D64C48
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8ba64d2556f84673eeddb564c989ca62990990afe97b9adea68d8b603772dbe
#. default-sha256: 0cb52d022bfc759533fb1e9326a1e24ad1d0bbc37cb3d9bd0029c33c13a69c6d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7264E601_7DDD_4CA2_9E95_82FC86D64C48"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫what was, I assumed, formerly a cross."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ipotizzai che un tempo fosse una croce."

#: scenario5:scenario5_CF7BE4A5_DE3F_454B_884D_538236B1ADDD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40a8a4c0fc7ac5aa844bfbac916d3ce890f97d6e97c7e2212ef05a29b1197749
#. default-sha256: 98e29ac5cb57fda73b6ebe9a3e1f31130ea8059c964a4aa4cdecfa0677ed925e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CF7BE4A5_DE3F_454B_884D_538236B1ADDD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Upon further reflection, rather than facing the window, the pews seemed to be pointed at the "
"pulpit—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫or perhaps the cross hanging on it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dopo un’ulteriore analisi notai che, anziché verso la finestra,⟪k:1⟫le panche sembravano "
"essere rivolte verso il pulpito—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫o forse verso la croce appesa su di esso."

#: scenario5:scenario5_8806818E_A5AA_4012_BC56_0518E7F4D082
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f76c7a98d64d2bf89b9ed779d04373c028d397836d1a4d5c3fcb375db3b7b8e
#. default-sha256: 7d5ac612d1e52617cde446508a9e98f0a8c87bb0f68768424db71a223c396e19
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8806818E_A5AA_4012_BC56_0518E7F4D082"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t sure why there would be a chapel in a mansion, but I had no one to ask about it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non ero sicura del perché ci fosse una cappella in una villa,⟪k:1⟫ma non c’era nessuno a cui "
"potessi chiederlo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_79CFBF33_6D18_4F97_81E6_C68B8B04EAB1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f3a47a71a251f4bc63b8a3bc10197432cbc31ada3b8150367154b295c2a38f3
#. default-sha256: 417aa85d6ae92cbdb7b2433caf4ac364669f66b820e402cabb7beef7e9c01638
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_79CFBF33_6D18_4F97_81E6_C68B8B04EAB1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(For a house of this size, a statue of Christ or the Virgin Mary seems more appropriate.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Per una casa di queste dimensioni, una statua di Cristo o della Vergine Maria sarebbe più "
"appropriata.)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_85244C87_58DA_4179_A1C6_C3252AEFA550
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5e4487fcc7e78eeb777a8f24b993f2e1819e653c13a1b70fed7473bf6ee9bff
#. default-sha256: 252079679dd9d1016144c17b07a523f539ec71970402a4e5c02667cff483e9ae
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_85244C87_58DA_4179_A1C6_C3252AEFA550"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(It’s a very well made chapel, at any rate...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(In ogni caso è una cappella molto ben fatta...)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9103FB9B_FF59_407A_B1F5_4CDFE900CFFD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6efc705f3128cd902180e6e085e74e4b8cdc9ca807d80eac65ce49750964cc72
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9103FB9B_FF59_407A_B1F5_4CDFE900CFFD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario5:scenario5_D29F27E2_EC0C_4621_956D_C2A2CD962404
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40f89773ccdd84e42692bfa595af07d7b4452c9d5a00c9c934cc2dd3874a598b
#. default-sha256: edb998dcf6b05f0cf7decb637001970e4f4ba588051803d9cadef9a5131844d7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D29F27E2_EC0C_4621_956D_C2A2CD962404"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I doubted Michel had had it built for himself. ⟪k:1⟫There would be no reason for him to "
"cover the window if that were the case."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dubitavo che Michel l’avesse fatta costruire da solo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Se così fosse stato, non "
"avrebbe avuto alcun motivo di coprire la⟪k:3⟫finestra."

#: scenario5:scenario5_3A7A3407_AF3B_41E4_924C_5F34794B7486
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d30c7d07c809b29c055f6c4cf6afa7317024f3ab06430ff5974a52fda67e7f9c
#. default-sha256: eee1ba2e436d8951db67d66183c6c9d14cd7e9cbf11296bfeb1ac968861728c1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3A7A3407_AF3B_41E4_924C_5F34794B7486"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nor had I ever seen him come to pray."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Oltretutto, non l’avevo mai visto andare lì a pregare."

#: scenario5:scenario5_BF6E0F10_588D_4AFA_9436_A66EFD5A59CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad20bf0565cf931bc9c2f5b8a26da2e781707de1b9fc652ecdf556b7b3ee4a5c
#. default-sha256: 061ac832c6ebcbd85c9ec6567a29699e2d75626770d66d4b69321bfc592a4b43
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BF6E0F10_588D_4AFA_9436_A66EFD5A59CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(He doesn’t seem like one to believe in God.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Non ha l’aria di essere credente.)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0A56A746_2279_407F_84FC_A7A3CE7E50E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4a313d648274264b8466a7f4714a14ebfd365e0fbf8d65b6effbdd8f12dc19b
#. default-sha256: 1852b47b6f51ae243400344de26e5fbccd55c53b2eea05882144d416e4c65d4a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0A56A746_2279_407F_84FC_A7A3CE7E50E5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(God...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(...Dio...)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E5007458_122E_4125_9932_037BFC3EE5D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6c0e5ada003f09f60f36d0296f57d02184ca174073db88447a993571b9209a7
#. default-sha256: f2d81e377f79a30f1a18519717ce0ef487fde5913f7978bc243ff84cd8e16503
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E5007458_122E_4125_9932_037BFC3EE5D4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I’m not even sure if I...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Non sono sicura nemmeno che io...)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F9324163_17D1_4F00_8DBD_339C28934087
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1a45fadb0610f2bf10229d94c8a13a5ea60fc14e3423faf8560fdce1a61ba20
#. default-sha256: 0a6649b14ef48925433f962a98d486f2b3ec4bc375830487b0be256ba1bf14a4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F9324163_17D1_4F00_8DBD_339C28934087"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If God ⟪k:1⟫really⟪k:2⟫ existed, then surely the world would be a much more pleasant, "
"peaceful place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se Dio esistesse ⟪k:1⟫davvero⟪k:2⟫, allora il mondo sarebbe di certo un posto molto più "
"piacevole e pacifico."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B5F3B961_B5CF_45E1_9686_D8F1AD89AF1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17e225dfc7884a6d495566472a4049cf0bbfd846a817739f41ee522d6a7adb69
#. default-sha256: 5cc7d38209c5d99196816225091be5a63477a23858201263d4abd528ee567c86
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B5F3B961_B5CF_45E1_9686_D8F1AD89AF1C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No unfair disparities in money or power. ⟪k:1⟫No senseless misfortune.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I certainly "
"wouldn’t have found myself here, either..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nessuna ingiusta disparità di denaro o potere.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nessuna insensata sciagura.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"E di certo io non mi sarei ritrovata lì..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_41BF1485_75AA_4EEA_940F_4F8D64CB0688
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b1b0faa0f1e446a3af4ba7cd9fc06284349b124de8c8064ce1c576644d515c7
#. default-sha256: c73ec71c9b9e5b8ac084292557e5d0436d45842b54cf6b79fcf6e29f3e371fb4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_41BF1485_75AA_4EEA_940F_4F8D64CB0688"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But God was evidently quite fond of giving mankind “trials,” so He would probably tell me "
"with a straight face that this was one too."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma evidentemente a Dio piaceva mettere alla prova il genere umano, quindi mi avrebbe "
"probabilmente detto con lo sguardo serio che anche quello era un test."

#: scenario5:scenario5_4D835E2E_5E7F_4F39_9C1A_1B4F94821963
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d121c75ca6281602563278e18531824d1514bf4adf6d803ff7e7c83e2dacaab2
#. default-sha256: 7e289be009e518ba9fd24da3ae5b3cd18ce25fcb2f9d2c07b9c0d4adde39edcd
