msgid "⟪k:0⟫so we tried to make the best of what we were able to take in between the three of us."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫quindi cercavamo di sfruttare al meglio ciò che noi tre eravamo⟪k:1⟫in grado di fare."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0A4E61B0_4FB0_44B4_A6E4_86DA8AEAA2BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1031c5d7d6b0646bed01231feabef296e0d8650967ca81f90a1b1155e5898524
