msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0A4E61B0_4FB0_44B4_A6E4_86DA8AEAA2BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Then, my sister fell in love with a moderately well-off aristocrat. ⟪k:1⟫Both my mom and I "
"were supportive of her and her desire to marry."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫In seguito, mia sorella si innamorò di un aristocratico moderatamente benestante. ⟪k:1⟫Mia "
"madre ed io eravamo entrambe d’accordo con lei e il suo desiderio di sposarsi."

#: scenario5:scenario5_CE4F5CD4_0E48_451B_9DA3_6F0C0607605C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 561249c9b13fb31fe917b689487f33f9d738d91e8f15751fea0cee30b5ed8971
#. default-sha256: 5267ed1ccc43dfc53a6c19a49580c393fd1ed8fe977aaaaf7a250864c39124fb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CE4F5CD4_0E48_451B_9DA3_6F0C0607605C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But their union almost fell apart because she was “not suitable” for him. ⟪k:1⟫Merchants "
"were hardly the lowest class—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma la loro unione era quasi crollata perché lei non era “adatta” per lui. ⟪k:1⟫I mercanti "
"non erano affatto la classe più bassa—"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0949ED31_09F9_472D_B559_50857937E097
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f612e192ea3459aabe83e3b4af97d7ab8863983ee58add3b433e63b65df70347
