msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ad ogni modo, non avevamo mai realmente interagito."

#: scenario5:scenario5_EDC25772_6FD0_4379_8CB0_AC20CD043121
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bced2ef3283ad1f195fdf4f00614013adab688c2b5c18bd8974d218fc7298663
