msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EDC25772_6FD0_4379_8CB0_AC20CD043121"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was tasked with keeping track of whether I was still alive,⟪k:1⟫and whether I remained in "
"the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era stato incaricato di assicurarsi che fossi ancora vivo, e che restassi nella villa."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B08CD1B8_5841_4077_80E2_B5FDD43F4561
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab4228a475d494d174642dddb83a651f7d63294f763aa16458e15849977ac2c8
