msgid "⟪k:0⟫The monthly package from my family was delivered to him, which he then passed on to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il pacco mensile della mia famiglia veniva consegnato a lui, che poi lo recapitava a me."

#: scenario5:scenario5_BF5F350B_D14F_4801_A0E4_294455B030ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 649144ab84bae93e4e8efb9e1a24399f0cc6fcca746fa5d52bc20f6c9c0240c9
