msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il servitore era visibilmente scosso.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Impaurito, anche."

#: scenario5:scenario5_4892622C_55C2_40E3_A76E_132685EB8930
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5db663cdddc84afe33f26ad256cafad20defede4319d4f80186d0bc9d6a0a7e
