msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4892622C_55C2_40E3_A76E_132685EB8930"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But not because of the difference in our social ranks.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I had a pretty good idea "
"what he had been told about me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma non a causa della differenza nel nostro rango.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Avevo un’idea precisa di cosa gli "
"fosse stato detto sul mio conto."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A6B5FDE9_7CFC_44E4_AA3A_525555B391FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2699365c7e27746cfbff2f901d4449615020e1ab57ebc667566cbf5b5564501c
