msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was afraid of me—⟪k:1⟫or, more specifically, my “curse.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Aveva paura di me—⟪k:1⟫o più specificamente, della mia “maledizione”."

#: scenario5:scenario5_73B3BAAB_0B87_488C_B2D7_AF85D48DFD2A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 82d089f622cca3ddc415397e1776ae3ab79e35eb0338f401f41368de2f10b896
