msgid "⟪k:0⟫People fear that which they cannot comprehend."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La gente ha paura di ciò che non riesce a comprendere."

#: scenario5:scenario5_8858CFD7_1C9E_403F_BE29_29AB4D14B666
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 218e20215ed184fa6d542fdfee82d0f5451c0e7e05ece370c85270374891b9ef
