msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8858CFD7_1C9E_403F_BE29_29AB4D14B666"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not just children. ⟪k:1⟫Adults as well.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫They fear demons, witches, and curses—⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫anything impure or not of this world."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non solo i bambini. ⟪k:1⟫Ma anche gli adulti.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Temono i demoni, le streghe, e le "
"maledizioni—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫tutto ciò che è impuro o che non appartiene a questo mondo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2B7D2F46_2DFB_4137_8567_D75248BD5D66
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ebd966534e2b0eb6a2b643ecb4ae7547ed8be5ae54aed26796145c11d57deff
#. default-sha256: 9af8a6675fe86cc194c0e543115f8b7d9a84b19d3ac5df2e8b96b54933d6aa51
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2B7D2F46_2DFB_4137_8567_D75248BD5D66"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I had long since gotten used to being viewed as such.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It didn’t sadden me. ⟪k:3⟫"
"It didn’t disappoint me. ⟪k:4⟫It didn’t pain me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma ero abituato da tempo ad essere visto come tale.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il che non mi rattristava. ⟪k:3⟫"
"Non mi amareggiava. ⟪k:4⟫Non mi addolorava."

#: scenario5:scenario5_FEFFF620_927D_421C_8A7D_35DD35991C84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 769d73a1bc1e6e7c8cc1d2ca09b253e59f41d2a22241085038bf0bc6023f87af
