msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Though it certainly doesn’t make me feel ⟪k:1⟫good⟪k:2⟫, either...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Sebbene di certo non mi faccia nemmeno stare ⟪k:1⟫bene⟪k:2⟫...)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_06C0FA16_D4C5_4F7F_8ED1_B1589D9048A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 337d4ff1dcbdaf2fd0e49f9da27ace5784fd32223b57ae907ff1f831fafb3796
