msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_06C0FA16_D4C5_4F7F_8ED1_B1589D9048A7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was, on some level, annoyed. ⟪k:1⟫That woman’s appearance at the mansion had created "
"ripples in my once tranquil life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ero in qualche modo infastidito. ⟪k:1⟫La comparsa di quella donna nella villa aveva generato "
"delle increspature nella mia vita un tempo tranquilla."

#: scenario5:scenario5_3B93AE2A_7CA4_40B2_881D_59CD52465D40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1bbd0d0fc9433f9d56d1c857d5fb6ed91a9ab809e114ca514a22bb4066689220
