msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3B93AE2A_7CA4_40B2_881D_59CD52465D40"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So before I got into the real reason for my visit, I decided to...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫take out a bit "
"of my frustration."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E così, prima di entrare nel merito della questione, decisi di...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫tirare fuori un "
"po’ della mia frustrazione."

#: scenario5:scenario5_DAEFFD6E_3626_4EE1_8021_7799F467F2D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 806d2052ed29902e878417170503c9f076b91eba0b1149f7a8e6d281cd49a1b0
#. default-sha256: f26e364349a4326ad3d8e36d7a84e6ba74a3704a340aeb6c33c470df4c1dca37
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DAEFFD6E_3626_4EE1_8021_7799F467F2D0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Raise your head. There’s no need to be afraid.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I don’t know what you’ve been told, "
"but I promise I don’t bite."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Solleva la testa. Non c’è bisogno di avere paura.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non so cosa ti è stato detto, ma "
"ti assicuro che non mordo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_17E8D954_ADD7_4BB8_9725_87CEB787C995
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bafd27dcc9c7c406b819e8b33a3140a14bf86741f56d5cf7418c2dc5af83052b
