msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_17E8D954_ADD7_4BB8_9725_87CEB787C995"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A-⟪k:1⟫Ahh... ⟪k:2⟫how rude of me.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You’re right. My sincerest apologies."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A-⟪k:1⟫Ahh... ⟪k:2⟫che maleducato che sono.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ha ragione. Le mie più sincere scuse."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5C0659D5_1B4B_4F90_896E_E45A1B284299
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10bd1f5c0927b05171106ddc7e20af108d681ad41f272cedd41d4ddf14092acb
