msgid "⟪k:0⟫what will you do if I try to run?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I would have little trouble escaping."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫cosa farai qualora tentassi di scappare?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Avrei ben poche difficoltà a fuggire."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D96EE904_40FA_4353_B67A_49318B3721FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2ef7f214215bc9a03786cacaf313ff8e1abad38b21b04c3125c596ff8c60ace
